  "settingsXraySniffingRouteOnlyHint": "Off (default): the sniffed domain becomes the destination, so it is resolved again — locally for direct routes, on the server for proxied ones. On: the domain is used only to pick a rule, and the connection still goes to the address the app supplied — which is wrong whenever that address came from a resolver on the far side of the tunnel (RU sites then load over a direct route to a foreign CDN node).",
